<span id="A3.SS1.p10.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p10.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Age:</span> 13</span>
<span id="A3.SS1.p10.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p10.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Gender:</span> Female</span>
<span id="A3.SS1.p10.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p10.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Personality:</span> High Agreeableness</span>
<span id="A3.SS1.p10.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p10.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Class Role:</span> Academic Student</span>
<span id="A3.SS1.p10.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p10.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Learning Motivation:</span> High</span>
<span id="A3.SS1.p10.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p10.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Class Behavior:</span> Frequently engages in peer interaction, supports others’ ideas, and shows strong cooperative communication.</span>
<span id="A3.SS1.p10.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p10.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Cognitive Style:</span> Field-independent</span>
<span id="A3.SS1.p10.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p10.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Thinking Tendency:</span> Reflective</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS1.p11" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.SS1.p11.pic1" class="ltx_picture" color="#000000" height="321.04" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 321.04" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,321.04) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#D9D9D9;" fill="#D9D9D9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 321.04 L 550 321.04 L 550 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 0.69 L 0.69 302.17 L 549.31 302.17 L 549.31 0.69 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 306.8)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:32em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="9.61" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="442.79"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
