</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 15.19)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.8em;--ltx-fo-height:19.89em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="277.86" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 275.17)" width="509.21"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.SS1.p12.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.8em;">
<span id="A3.SS1.p12.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p12.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Age:</span> 13</span>
<span id="A3.SS1.p12.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p12.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Gender:</span> Female</span>
<span id="A3.SS1.p12.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p12.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Personality:</span> Low Openness</span>
<span id="A3.SS1.p12.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p12.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Class Role:</span> Off-task Student</span>
<span id="A3.SS1.p12.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p12.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Learning Motivation:</span> Low</span>
<span id="A3.SS1.p12.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p12.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Class Behavior:</span> Easily distracted in class, often avoids eye contact, but occasionally responds with emotional expressions.</span>
<span id="A3.SS1.p12.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p12.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Cognitive Style:</span> Field-dependent</span>
<span id="A3.SS1.p12.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p12.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Thinking Tendency:</span> Impulsive</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS1.p13" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.SS1.p13.pic1" class="ltx_picture" color="#000000" height="323.73" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 323.73" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,323.73) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#D9D9D9;" fill="#D9D9D9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 323.73 L 550 323.73 L 550 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 0.69 L 0.69 302.17 L 549.31 302.17 L 549.31 0.69 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 309.49)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:32em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="442.79"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.SS1.p13.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:32em;">
<span id="A3.SS1.p13.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p13.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#006D2C;">Zhang Tao</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 15.19)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.8em;--ltx-fo-height:19.89em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="277.86" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 275.17)" width="509.21"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.SS1.p13.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.8em;">
<span id="A3.SS1.p13.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p13.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Age:</span> 14</span>
<span id="A3.SS1.p13.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p13.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Gender:</span> Male</span>
<span id="A3.SS1.p13.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p13.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Personality:</span> Low Conscientiousness</span>
<span id="A3.SS1.p13.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p13.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Class Role:</span> Off-task Student</span>
<span id="A3.SS1.p13.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p13.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Learning Motivation:</span> Low</span>
<span id="A3.SS1.p13.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p13.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Class Behavior:</span> Tends to disengage from class tasks, shows low participation, and often chats about irrelevant topics.</span>
<span id="A3.SS1.p13.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p13.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Cognitive Style:</span> Field-dependent</span>
<span id="A3.SS1.p13.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p13.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Thinking Tendency:</span> Impulsive</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.2 </span>Evaluation Metric</h3>

<div id="A3.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<ul id="A3.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A3.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">IRF rate (Initiation–Response–Feedback rate).</span><span id="A3.I1.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
Defined as the proportion of time steps in which a complete IRF cycle is realized, i.e., a teacher initiation (</span><math id="A3.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I_{T}^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">I</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">T</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I_{T}^{t}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A3.I1.i1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">), followed by a student response (</span><math id="A3.I1.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{S}^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">R</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">S</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{S}^{t}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A3.I1.i1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">), and completed with teacher feedback (</span><math id="A3.I1.i1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{T}^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">F</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">T</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{T}^{t}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A3.I1.i1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">). This metric captures instructional alignment between teacher and students.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Behavior categories (ICAP framework).</span><span id="A3.I1.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
We classify student behaviors into four categories:
</span><em id="A3.I1.i2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Active</em><span id="A3.I1.i2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> (e.g., answering questions, note-taking),
</span><em id="A3.I1.i2.p1.1.5" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Passive</em><span id="A3.I1.i2.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> (e.g., listening, reading),
</span><em id="A3.I1.i2.p1.1.7" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Interactive</em><span id="A3.I1.i2.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> (e.g., peer discussion, asking questions), and
</span><em id="A3.I1.i2.p1.1.9" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Off-Class</em><span id="A3.I1.i2.p1.1.10" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> (e.g., off-task, inattentive).</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Cognition categories (Bloom’s taxonomy).</span><span id="A3.I1.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
Cognitive engagement is divided into two levels:
</span><em id="A3.I1.i3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Lower-order cognition</em><span id="A3.I1.i3.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> (Remember, Understand) and
</span><em id="A3.I1.i3.p1.1.5" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Higher-order cognition</em><span id="A3.I1.i3.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> (Apply, Analyze, Evaluate, Create).</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Emotion categories.</span><span id="A3.I1.i4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
Emotional states are coded into three classes:
</span><em id="A3.I1.i4.p1.1.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Positive</em><span id="A3.I1.i4.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">,
</span><em id="A3.I1.i4.p1.1.5" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Negative</em><span id="A3.I1.i4.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">, and
</span><em id="A3.I1.i4.p1.1.7" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Confused</em><span id="A3.I1.i4.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span></p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.3 </span>Experiment I</h3>

<figure id="A3.T4" class="ltx_table">

<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table A4: </span><span id="A3.T4.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">IRF distribution for three text genres across four environments.</span>
Values are relative frequencies of Initiation (I), Response (R), and Feedback (F).
<span id="A3.T4.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">IRF_rate</span> denotes the overall completion ratio.</figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
